#. Tag: author
#: csphere.docbook:3
#, no-c-format
msgid "<firstname>Jason</firstname> <surname>Harris</surname>"
msgstr "<firstname>Jason</firstname> <surname>Harris</surname>"

#. Tag: title
#: csphere.docbook:8
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Celestial Sphere"
msgstr "A esfera celeste"

#. Tag: primary
#: csphere.docbook:9
#, no-c-format
msgid "Celestial Sphere"
msgstr "Esfera celeste"

#. Tag: seealso
#: csphere.docbook:10
#, no-c-format
msgid "Celestial Coordinate Systems"
msgstr "Sistemas de coordenadas celestes"

#. Tag: para
#: csphere.docbook:12
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The celestial sphere is an imaginary sphere of gigantic radius, centered on the "
"Earth. All objects which can be seen in the sky can be thought of as lying on "
"the surface of this sphere."
msgstr ""
"A esfera celeste é unha esfera imaxinaria que raio xigante, centrada na terra. "
"Pode suporse que todos os obxectos que poden verse no ceo poden están na "
"superficie desta esfera."

#. Tag: para
#: csphere.docbook:16
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Of course, we know that the objects in the sky are not on the surface of a "
"sphere centered on the Earth, so why bother with such a construct? Everything "
"we see in the sky is so very far away, that their distances are impossible to "
"gauge just by looking at them. Since their distances are indeterminate, you "
"only need to know the <emphasis>direction</emphasis> "
"toward the object to locate it in the sky. In this sense, the celestial sphere "
"model is a very practical model for mapping the sky."
msgstr ""
"Por suposto, sabemos que os obxectos celestes non están na superficie dunha "
"esfera centrada na terra, entón, por que preocuparse por tal cousa? Todo o que "
"vemos no ceo está tan lonxe, que é imposíbel medir a distancia á que están "
"simplesmente ollando para eles. Xa que as distancias están indeterminadas, "
"só precisa coñecer a <emphasis>dirección</emphasis> cara eles para localizalos "
"no ceo. Neste senso, o modelo da esfera celeste é moi prática para descreber "
"o ceo."

#. Tag: para
#: csphere.docbook:24
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The directions toward various objects in the sky can be quantified by "
"constructing a <link linkend=\"ai-skycoords\">Celestial Coordinate System</link>"
"."
msgstr ""
"As direccións cara os diferentes obxectos no ceo poden cuantificarse construindo "
"un <link linkend=\"ai-skycoords\">sistema de coordenadas celestes</link>."

